<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Public routes of the application, mirroring app.routes.ts. Routes whose `data.seo` there sets
    noindex (settings, profile, auth/callback, template, the 404 fallback) are deliberately
    absent: a sitemap must not advertise a page whose own head asks not to be indexed.

    Two things to change per deployment:
      - the host below, which is the live host from src/environments/live.environment.ts;
      - the page list, once the template's placeholder pages are replaced by real ones. Listing
        a thin lorem-ipsum page is worse than not listing it.
-->
